    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "You are a dog in this 3D Platforming throwback adventure!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChomp Ice Kubes, collect Cartridges, Discs, Vinyl, and Hidden Treasures within each level!<br />\r\nEvery levels Collectible Vinyl unlocks in-game music, with over a dozen tracks!<br />\r\nReturn to any completed level and grab the hourglass to start a Time Trial!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nReturn to the HUB WORLD between levels to admire your collection and listen to your Vinyl. <br />\r\nCompleting Worlds rewards you with Denim Washes to customize your Vest.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCollecting each Worlds Collectables unlocks their corresponding Zoomie Level!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDo you have what it takes to escape the TV, unlock the Secret Levels, and ultimately be a Good Boy?",
    "about_the_game": "You are a dog in this 3D Platforming throwback adventure!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChomp Ice Kubes, collect Cartridges, Discs, Vinyl, and Hidden Treasures within each level!<br />\r\nEvery levels Collectible Vinyl unlocks in-game music, with over a dozen tracks!<br />\r\nReturn to any completed level and grab the hourglass to start a Time Trial!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nReturn to the HUB WORLD between levels to admire your collection and listen to your Vinyl. <br />\r\nCompleting Worlds rewards you with Denim Washes to customize your Vest.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCollecting each Worlds Collectables unlocks their corresponding Zoomie Level!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDo you have what it takes to escape the TV, unlock the Secret Levels, and ultimately be a Good Boy?",
    "short_description": "You are a dog. Bark, Jump, Sprint, and Zoom to collect all the treasures and escape the TV! Master the speed of your paws and the might of your leap to traverse All Five Worlds in this handcrafted adventure.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
